# Prairie Dog's replacement needs both: "you would put" and "a creature you control" (CR 614.1a, 122.6). With it active on turn 3,
# Bot1's Honor puts one counter on Bot2's Memnite (not Bot1's creature): a 2/2, not 3/3. Bot2's own Fleeting Flight, cast on Bot1's
# Dog in response, puts one counter on it (Bot2 is the putter): 3/3. Bot1's Dog then grows at the end step - Bot1 cast Honor, a spell
# from its hand, so there is no counter and it stays 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Prairie Dog
Honor
Mox Pearl
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Mox Pearl
Fleeting Flight
Island x17

